      "title": "SMB2: Added number of matched names in SMB2 Find",
      "message": "SMB2: Added number of matched names in SMB2 Find\n\nAdded the number of matched names in Find responses to the tree\nand Packet List. Also fixed a bug that prevented the search\npattern in Find responses from being displayed in the Packet List.\n",
      "author_name": "Cal Turney",
