      "title": "SMB2: Added a FID hash to all SMB2 types",
      "message": "SMB2: Added a FID hash to all SMB2 types\n\nAdded a File ID Hash to the 11 file-related SMB2 command types.\nIf the FID is filtered, only the CREATE response and the\nrequests of the other 10 types are returned. The FID hash\nreturns all SMB2 requests and responses.\n",
      "author_name": "Cal Turney",
      "author_email": "cturney111@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2024-10-08T19:18:15.000-04:00",
